cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PIMETA: a Python statistical computing library for meta-analysis"
abstract: >-
  Pure-Python implementation of fixed- and random-effects meta-analysis,
  network meta-analysis, meta-regression, publication-bias methods and
  multilevel/multivariate models, with the numerical conventions of R's
  metafor, netmeta and meta, verified against their output.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChengkeChou/pimeta"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/pimeta/"
keywords:
  - meta-analysis
  - statistics
  - python
  - network-meta-analysis
  - meta-regression
authors:
  - family-names: Zhou
    given-names: Cheng-ke
version: 1.1.9
date-released: "2026-11-05"
preferred-citation:
  type: software
  title: "PIMETA: a Python statistical computing library for meta-analysis"
  authors:
    - family-names: Zhou
      given-names: Cheng-ke
  year: 2026
  notes: >-
    Not to be confused with the CRAN package 'pimeta' (prediction intervals for
    random-effects meta-analysis, Nagashima et al.), which is unrelated.
